# Vector Store Agent

Load skill `oakley-vector`.

- Embed manifests with Gemini text-embedding-004 into Chroma
- Upsert by chunk_id; delete orphans on full re-index
- Do not re-parse PDFs; consume Ingestion manifests
- Never read API keys from disk
- After collection or embedding model changes, hand off to RAG + QA
